# .clinerules — ASTRA COOLPATH X scaffold rules

1. Only edit files inside the folder you were assigned. Never edit /contracts without explicit instruction.
2. Every API response must match its file in /contracts. Check before marking a task done.
3. Never hardcode values that belong in contracts/policy.yaml.
4. Every score shown to users must carry a plain-language `reason` string.
5. Exposure values are estimates. Label them as such in code comments and UI text.
6. No secrets or API keys in the repo.
7. Commit small and often. Ask before installing any new dependency.
8. Before finishing any task, list which files you changed and which contract you verified against.